Spec: Control frame codec

Purpose:
  Preserve exact control payload boundaries over a byte stream.

Owns:
  ./FrameCodec.cs

Must:
  Delegate framing to the portable wire codec while preserving the existing Broker API.
  Encode length as four unsigned little-endian bytes; accept `1` through `65536` payload bytes.
  Return clean EOF only before the header; reject truncated headers and bodies.
  Pass cancellation through reads, writes and flushes without allocating over-limit bodies.
